  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Salut ! Tu viens de la part de Millie, c’est ça ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530061006C00750074002000210020005400750020007600690065006E00730020006400650020006C0061002000700061007200740020006400650020004D0069006C006C00690065002C002000632019006500730074002000E700610020003F00100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dans ce cas, j’entre dans le vif du sujet !\nJ’ai une mission pour toi !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En fait, je m’intéresse à l’évolution des Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E00200066006100690074002C0020006A00650020006D20190069006E007400E900720065007300730065002000E00020006C201900E90076006F006C007500740069006F006E002000640065007300200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002E00100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu sais, c’est le procédé au cours duquel ils\nchangent d’apparence et deviennent plus forts.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIls évoluent en gagnant des Points d’Expérience,\nou en devenant nos amis. Bref, je t’apprends rien.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 200
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Moi, ce qui m’intéresse plus particulièrement,\nce sont les pierres d’évolution !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et il se trouve que j’ai une Pierre Foudre en\nma possession !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045007400200069006C002000730065002000740072006F00750076006500200071007500650020006A20190061006900200075006E0065002000500069006500720072006500200046006F007500640072006500200065006E000A006D006100200070006F007300730065007300730069006F006E0020002100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le souci, c’est que...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500200073006F007500630069002C0020006320190065007300740020007100750065002E002E002E00100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bah, j’ai pas de Pokémon qui évolue avec\nune Pierre Foudre.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200610068002C0020006A201900610069002000700061007300200064006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0020007100750069002000E90076006F006C0075006500200061007600650063000A0075006E0065002000500069006500720072006500200046006F0075006400720065002E00100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je me suis renseignée et apparemment, je peux\nl’utiliser sur un Pikachu.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bref, t’as deviné ce que j’attends de toi.\nJe voudrais que tu m’amènes un Pikachu !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bien sûr, tu seras récompensé<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe ! Si tu m’aides,\nje te donnerai mon Scarhino en échange !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Amène-moi un Pikachu et je te l’échangerai\ncontre mon Scarhino !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSi t’en as pas, je crois que tu peux en capturer\ndans la zone sauvage nº 3 !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 149
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... Je rêve pas, t’as bien un Pikachu avec toi !\nAlors, tu me l’échanges contre mon Scarhino ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est d’accord !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00432019006500730074002000642019006100630063006F00720064002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tout bien réfléchi...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006F007500740020006200690065006E0020007200E90066006C00E9006300680069002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... Quoi ? Tu vas le garder pour toi ?\nEt ta mission ? T’avais promis de me l’échanger !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merveilleux ! Perdons pas de temps !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00650072007600650069006C006C0065007500780020002100200050006500720064006F006E00730020007000610073002000640065002000740065006D007000730020002100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Salut Pikachu ! C’est un plaisir d’être ta nouvelle\nDresseuse !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530061006C00750074002000500069006B00610063006800750020002100200043201900650073007400200075006E00200070006C0061006900730069007200200064201900EA0074007200650020007400610020006E006F007500760065006C006C0065000A0044007200650073007300650075007300650020002100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pour fêter notre rencontre, je vais utiliser\ncette Pierre Foudre !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F007500720020006600EA0074006500720020006E006F007400720065002000720065006E0063006F006E007400720065002C0020006A0065002000760061006900730020007500740069006C0069007300650072000A00630065007400740065002000500069006500720072006500200046006F00750064007200650020002100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pikachu a évolué en Raichu !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500069006B006100630068007500200061002000E90076006F006C007500E900200065006E00200052006100690063006800750020002100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mmm... Mon Pokédex dit que quand il se charge\nen électricité, il est plus agressif et...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n... il risque de nous attaquer ?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 130
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah ben d’accord, c’est rassurant...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nD’ailleurs, tu savais que la Pierre Foudre est pas\nla seule pierre d’évolution qui existe ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bref, merci pour ton aide.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042007200650066002C0020006D006500720063006900200070006F0075007200200074006F006E00200061006900640065002E00100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Passe le bonjour à Millie de ma part !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000610073007300650020006C006500200062006F006E006A006F00750072002000E00020004D0069006C006C006900650020006400650020006D0061002000700061007200740020002100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Scari !",
